{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>kol chozeh</b> — a personal name." "<b>hu yivenenu</b> — future in place of past, or the meaning is: So-and-so took hold, and he — he will build it." "<b>ve-yetallelenu</b> — from the Aramaic Targum: <b>be-tzel</b> 'in the shade of' is rendered <b>be-talal</b>."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:01.220033236Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}